  "description": "Ever since inheriting his father’s debt as a teenager, Joo Ha-Won has been doing whatever it takes to buy his freedom back, whether that means working as a VIP dealer in the casinos of Macau, or taking other riskier jobs. In a world where money is worth more than lives, Ha-Won knows he’s always walking a fine line. But when a mysterious casino guest by the name of Kwon Tae-Ha offers to pay off his debt if he successfully finishes a job on a cruise ship, it’s too good an offer to turn down–despite his instincts warning him of obvious danger. With lives and livelihoods at stake, could this man be Ha-Won’s savior? Or will he be the devil that lures Ha-Won to depths deeper than he ever imagined? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
